#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:9
msgid "How the platform is assembled and executed"
msgstr "平台如何装配与执行"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:11
msgid ""
"Nexus is a statically assembled C11 MCU platform. It separates reusable "
"mechanisms from external product policy. One authored TOML selects exact "
"hardware and optional adapters; immutable I/O faces expose the chosen "
"private providers. The application owns execution and recovery. These are "
"current design boundaries, not whole-platform physical qualification."
msgstr ""
"Nexus 是静态装配的 C11 MCU 平台，将通用机制与外部产品策略分开。一份人工编写的 TOML 选择精确硬件与可选 adapter；不可变 "
"I/O 接口面暴露所选私有提供者。应用负责执行与恢复。这些是当前设计边界，不代表整个平台已经取得物理资格。"

