#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:35
msgid ""
"The source tree groups MCU families by vendor and CPU implementations by "
"instruction-set architecture. These directories describe ownership at build "
"time; they add no runtime dispatch or lookup layer. Public include paths, "
"target names and authored family identifiers remain stable."
msgstr ""
"源码树按厂家组织 MCU 系列，按指令集架构组织 CPU "
"实现。这些目录表达构建期所有权，不增加运行时分派或查找层。公共头文件路径、目标名称和人工配置中的系列标识保持稳定。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:40
msgid ""
"The [source-adjacent contracts](source-map.md) own the directory map and "
"layer README content. Native models implement the same public I/O contracts "
"under the Native SoC package. Shared register-protocol algorithms live under"
" `drivers/<kind>/<ip>/` only when the participating wrappers independently "
"establish their silicon semantics. Selected SoC targets compile these "
"private sources directly; the directory adds no runtime layer to FIG-01. "
"Cross-vendor SoC collaboration remains in `soc/common/`, while STM32 "
"identity access remains under `soc/stm32/common/`."
msgstr ""
"[源码相邻合同](source-map.md) 维护目录映射和各层 README 正文。Native 模型在 Native SoC 包下实现相同的公共 "
"I/O 合同。共享寄存器协议算法只有在参与的 wrapper 分别确认其硅片语义后，才位于 `drivers/<kind>/<ip>/`。所选 SoC "
"target 直接编译这些私有源文件；目录不会给 FIG-01 增加运行时层。跨厂家 SoC 协作保留在 `soc/common/`，STM32 "
"identity 访问保留在 `soc/stm32/common/`。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:49
msgid ""
"Each family's `configure/` package owns its capability policy, constructors "
"and lifecycle emission; Native uses `soc/native/configure/`. The explicit "
"provider map and shared leaf contracts remain in "
"`tools/configure/providers/`. Common parsing, resource arbitration, typed IR"
" and atomic publication stay in `tools/configure/`. Configuration tests stay"
" under `tools/configure/tests/providers/<family>/`. These are build-time "
"Python boundaries, independent of the C execution path."
msgstr ""
"每个家族的 `configure/` 包拥有能力策略、构造器与生命周期生成；Native 使用 `soc/native/configure/`。显式 "
"provider map 与共享叶子合同保留在 `tools/configure/providers/`。通用解析、资源仲裁、typed IR "
"和原子发布仍在 `tools/configure/`。配置测试仍在 "
"`tools/configure/tests/providers/<family>/`。这些是构建期 Python 边界，独立于 C 执行路径。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:57
msgid ""
"Common components and selected STM32 extensions have distinct source "
"ownership. Components are explicit targets; a chip-specific target still "
"requires its exact SoC, mode and backend, and its presence does not extend "
"the public support matrix."
msgstr ""
"通用组件与选定的 STM32 扩展具有不同的源码所有权。组件都是显式目标；芯片专用目标仍要求精确 SoC、模式和后端，其存在不会扩大公共支持矩阵。"

