"responsibility"
msgstr "当前初始化、失败撤回与保留的清理责任"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:173
msgid ""
"FIG-05 shows explicit startup and reverse cleanup. A static face can exist "
"before start and after stop; its pointer is not a capability to execute cold"
" hardware. Partial failure can retain irreversible watchdog effects or busy "
"borrows. Products must inspect primary and cleanup outcomes, continue the "
"real executor, and retain quarantined resources. Platform start never starts"
" a scheduler."
msgstr ""
"FIG-05 表达显式启动与逆序清理。静态接口面可以在启动前和停止后存在；其指针不授予操作未启动硬件的权限。部分失败可能留下不可逆 watchdog "
"效果或活跃借用。产品必须检查主要结果与清理结果，继续运行真实执行器，并保留隔离资源。平台启动从不启动调度器。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:179
msgid ""
"Physical Flash reports exact geometry and `program_flags`. An ECC fresh-"
"erase requirement belongs to the caller's provenance contract: all-FF "
"readback cannot prove unused ECC state, and a failed pulse requires another "
"erase. All-FF source units issue no pulse. A started pulse must settle "
"before return; an expired deadline prevents later pulses and never cancels "
"hardware already programming. Products own writable regions, voltage, "
"execution stalls, watchdog and power loss."
msgstr ""
"物理 Flash 报告精确 geometry 和 `program_flags`。ECC fresh-erase 是调用方的真实历史合同：全 FF "
"读回不能证明 ECC 未被编程，失败脉冲后必须重新擦除。全 FF 输入单元不产生脉冲。已启动的脉冲必须先排空才能返回；过期 deadline "
"只能阻止后续脉冲，不能取消正在编程的硬件。产品负责可写 region、电压、执行停顿、watchdog 与掉电策略。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:186
msgid ""
"Optional generated diagnosed start/stop entries write phase and controller "
"location to caller-owned cold-path storage. They retain no diagnostic "
"pointer and do not replace the primary/cleanup results or remaining-effect "
"obligations. See [the diagnostic contract](../design/official-"
"stm32-provider.md) for index meaning and failure responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"生成的可选 diagnosed start/stop "
"入口将阶段和控制器位置写入调用方拥有的冷路径存储，不保留诊断指针，也不替代主要结果、清理结果或剩余效果责任。索引含义与失败责任见[诊断合同](../design/official-"
"stm32-provider.md)。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:192
msgid "Costs and tradeoffs"
msgstr "成本与取舍"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:194
msgid ""
"A 32-bit face contains two pointers: eight bytes of readonly storage. "
"Provider/mode ops are shared; exact mutable state and selected buffers "
"remain separate. Indirection lets one public interface serve independent "
"concrete providers and GoogleMock ports. Its cost is one public dispatch and"
" code/readonly table retention; actual Flash/RAM and timing are measured on "
"the selected linked image."
msgstr ""
"32 位接口面包含两个指针，占用八字节只读存储。提供者／模式的 ops 共享；精确可变状态与所选缓冲区分开。间接调用允许同一公共接口服务独立具体提供者与"
" GoogleMock 端口。成本是一次公共分发以及保留代码／只读表；实际 Flash／RAM 与时序必须在所选链接镜像上测量。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:200
msgid ""
"Static assembly rejects conflicts early and prunes unselected drivers. It "
"deliberately forgoes hotplug discovery, runtime string registries, arbitrary"
" dynamic clock changes and automatic recovery policy. Optional shared owners"
" add explicitly budgeted slots and synchronization; direct single-executor "
"paths need no default OS lock or worker."
msgstr ""
"静态装配提前拒绝冲突，裁剪未选择驱动。它不提供热插拔发现、运行时字符串注册表、任意动态时钟变化或自动恢复策略。可选共享 owner "
"增加显式预算的槽与同步；直接单执行器路径不需要默认 OS 锁或执行任务。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:205
msgid ""
"Read [factory](factory.md), [ownership](ownership.md), the [integration "
"contract](../design/integration-contracts.md) and [exact "
"support](../reference/platforms/support.md). Architecture diagrams explain "
"mechanisms; tests, image checks and HIL establish their separate execution "
"scopes."
msgstr ""
"阅读[类型化工厂](factory.md)、[所有权](ownership.md)、[接入合同](../design/integration-"
"contracts.md)和[精确支持范围](../reference/platforms/support.md)。架构图解释机制；测试、镜像检查和 "
"HIL 分别建立各自执行范围。"


msgid "Each of the eight maintained providers owns data-only `descriptor.py` metadata at its SoC package root, outside `configure/`. The central frozen `FamilyDescriptor` and explicit family-to-module map remain in `tools/configure/providers/descriptor.py`; the provider loader delegates that lookup without a second eager registry. A single `descriptor.maintained()` lookup loads only selected metadata, without configuration behavior; `providers.maintained()` uses that record to import the selected configure package. Explicit enumeration, source snapshots and SDK inventory may read all metadata. No descriptor becomes a second software source graph."
msgstr "八个维护中的 provider 各自在 SoC package 根目录拥有纯数据 `descriptor.py` 元数据，位于 `configure/` 之外。通用冻结 `FamilyDescriptor` 和显式 family-to-module map 仍在 `tools/configure/providers/descriptor.py`；provider loader 委托该查找，不另建 eager registry。单次 `descriptor.maintained()` 查找只加载所选元数据，不加载配置行为；`providers.maintained()` 使用该记录导入所选 configure package。显式枚举、源码快照和 SDK 清单可以读取全部元数据。descriptor 不成为第二份软件源码图。"


msgid "The constructor contract names private state, definitions, read-only admission, initialization, stop actions and failed-init responsibility explicitly. Admission, initializer and stop lists use immutable `DirectCall` values with explicit static references or constants; no free-form C expression or function-pointer/member-call expression can enter those fields. Definitions remain generated static C source and fixed connections; hardware algorithms are maintained in C. The C compiler establishes actual symbol and parameter types. Model tests and linked-image checks remain necessary: this narrow representation is not a complete typed C AST. Common generation does not infer these decisions from family names. Selected STM32F4 official LL operations remain inside private SoC state machines. Selected F407 UART `dma-tx` uses private HAL finite TX with disjoint LL IRQ RX under one owner; other UART modes retain their existing engines. The static shared-ops factory and public I/O contracts are unchanged. The current bounded U575 PWM/UART/RTC/GPIO, H743 SPI and five-SoC I2C operation changes select private LL/HAL calls at compile time inside their existing engines, with no additional runtime forwarding layer. These mode-specific integrations do not qualify another family or replace final clean-source evidence. See [official driver integration](../design/official-stm32-provider.md)."
msgstr "构造器合同显式命名私有 state、definition、只读 admission、initialization、stop action 和失败初始化责任。admission、initializer 和 stop 列表使用带显式静态引用或常量的不可变 `DirectCall`；这些字段不能包含自由 C 表达式或 function-pointer/member-call 表达式。definition 仍是生成的静态 C 源码和固定连接；硬件算法直接维护在 C 中。C 编译器建立实际 symbol 和参数类型。模型测试和链接镜像检查仍然必要：这个窄表示不是完整 typed C AST。公共生成器不会从 family 名推断这些决策。所选 STM32F4 官方 LL 操作仍在私有 SoC 状态机内。所选 F407 UART `dma-tx` 在一个 owner 内使用私有 HAL 有限 TX 和分离的 LL IRQ RX；其他 UART 模式保留既有引擎。静态共享 ops factory 和公共 I/O 合同不变。当前有界的 U575 PWM/UART/RTC/GPIO、H743 SPI 和五个 SoC 的 I2C 操作改动，在既有引擎内部通过编译期选择私有 LL/HAL 调用，没有额外的运行时转发层。这些逐模式集成不会授予其他 family 资格，也不能替代最终 clean-source 证据。见[官方驱动集成](../design/official-stm32-provider.md)。"
